"""
Short secrets sealed for storage, a TOTP seed for one: encrypted and
authenticated with ChaCha20-Poly1305 under a key of the server.

The key is a machine key of at least sealKeyBytes random bytes, read by
Wolly.Secret from a file of mode 0600; it is no password, so no Argon2id.
What seals is not the key itself but the HMAC-SHA256 of the purpose under
it, so that one key sealing for two purposes gives two keys, and a value
sealed for one purpose does not open for another.  The context, a user
name for one, is authenticated with the value: a sealed value copied to
another user's row does not open there.  Each seal takes a new random
nonce of 12 bytes and puts it in front of the ciphertext and the tag.
"""
import Standard.String (
    String
);

module Wolly.Seal is
    """
    The fewest bytes of a key: 32.
    """
    function sealKeyBytes(): Index
        ensures result = 32;

    """
    The bytes a sealed value has more than the value: 12 of nonce and 16
    of tag.
    """
    function overheadBytes(): Index
        ensures result = 28;

    """
    value sealed under key for purpose, bound to context.  None when key
    is shorter than sealKeyBytes, or the random source or libcrypto fails.
    No contract: an Option over a key from outside and the random
    source; None is its answer for a short key or a failure.
    """
    generic [K: Region, V: Region, C: Region]
    function sealValue(key: Span[Nat8, K], purpose: Span[Nat8, Static], value: Span[Nat8, V],
                       context: Span[Nat8, C]): Option[String];

    """
    The value of sealed, when it was sealed under key for purpose and bound
    to context, and nothing in it was changed.  None otherwise, and for a
    key shorter than sealKeyBytes or a sealed value shorter than
    overheadBytes.
    No contract: an Option over outside input; None is its answer for a
    bad one.
    """
    generic [K: Region, S: Region, C: Region]
    function openValue(key: Span[Nat8, K], purpose: Span[Nat8, Static], sealed: Span[Nat8, S],
                       context: Span[Nat8, C]): Option[String];
end module.
